WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.979
<v You>Claude does great work. But who has time to read all this?

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.392
<v You>And every question I type makes the session longer.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.560
<v Jarvis>Then don't read. Just talk to me.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.747
<v You>Jarvis, what did Claude just do?

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.628
<v Jarvis>It added a dark mode switch to settings, and the tests pass.

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.620
<v You>Nice. Ask it to add one to the home page too.

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.421
<v Jarvis>I wrote a clear request for Claude. Send it?

8
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.366
<v You>Send it.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.175
<v Jarvis>I talk beside your session, so I don't use up its memory.

10
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:32.558
<v Jarvis>I listen and speak on your Mac, and think with your own Claude plan. No API key.

11
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.287
<v Jarvis>I know the whole session, and I can search the web for answers.

12
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.055
<v Jarvis>You choose how I answer, and how I sound.

13
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:39.939
<v Jarvis (voice: Heart)>Like this?

14
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.153
<v Jarvis (voice: Emma)>Or like this.

15
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.635
<v Jarvis>Open Jarvis Talk. Stop reading. Start talking.
